(7474783, 1187586, 101256, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t know what to say about this. I don''t get the whole composition construction from the cat on down. Still, technically competent so it rates an 8 - even though I don''t have a club. :)</td>', 'I honestly don''t know what to say about this. I don''t get the whole composition construction from the cat on down. Still, technically competent so it rates an 8 - even though I don''t have a club. :)', '2016-09-20 17:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
