(7474795, 1187633, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this several times before I decided what it was that I originally saw. Obviously there is more to interpreting this image than just simple technique. After thinking about it and seeing where I might not appreciate the nuances of this image, but others would, I''m moving this from a 7 to a 10. Well done.</td>', 'I had to come back to this several times before I decided what it was that I originally saw. Obviously there is more to interpreting this image than just simple technique. After thinking about it and seeing where I might not appreciate the nuances of this image, but others would, I''m moving this from a 7 to a 10. Well done.', '2016-09-20 17:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
